<title>USA: Genusm Inc names Bobel CFO.</title>
<headline>Genusm Inc names Bobel CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genus Inc, a supplier of semiconductor capital equipment, on Monday said it has named Mary Bobel as its new chief financial officer, replacing Ernest Quinones.</p>
<p>Quinones had been named acting CFO in May last year to replace Kent Robertson, who resigned to take a similar position at another company.</p>
<p>Bobel, 47, was most recently chief financial officer at Mountain View, Calif.-based Educational Publishing Corp.</p>
